1	// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
2	
3	//! `PolicyService`: authored Cedar policy/template CRUD use cases (SMA-444 Task 17,
4	//! ADR-0013). Every operation is platform-scoped — `PutPolicy`/`DeletePolicy`/`ListPolicies`
5	//! are Root-only actions (design §3.2: only `platform_admin` holds them), so every method
6	//! authorizes against `root_prn()` before ever touching the store. The store itself
7	//! (`PolicyStore::put`/`delete`) separately rejects mutation of an already-persisted
8	//! `system = true` row (`AuthzError::SystemImmutable` -> `TenancyError::SystemImmutable`) —
9	//! this service does not duplicate that check.
